    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Ryan are delighted to present 51 Ashdale, Dún An Óir, Kanturk, Co. Cork to the market for sale. This impressive three-bedroom, three-bathroom end-of-terrace residence offers exceptionally spacious and beautifully presented accommodation, extending to approximately 137 sq.m. and ideally positioned within walking distance of Kanturk town and its wide range of amenities.\n\nBuilt C. 2006, the property has undergone extensive upgrading and refurbishment within the last three years and is presented to the market in excellent turnkey condition. The contemporary finish throughout creates a bright, comfortable and inviting home, allowing the new owners to move in and enjoy the property immediately without the need for further works.\n\nOne of the standout features of No. 51 is its generous proportions. Extending to C. 137 sq.m., the property provides an excellent level of living and bedroom accommodation, considerably enhancing its appeal as a family home. The end-of-terrace position further adds to the sense of space and privacy.\n\nThe property comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms and three bathrooms, complemented by spacious living accommodation ideally suited to modern family life. Practical features include a central vacuum system, water softener and a floored attic, providing valuable additional storage space.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front, while to the rear lies an attractive garden complete with decking, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining or relaxing during the warmer months.\n\nThe home is serviced by oil-fired central heating and holds an impressive B3 Building Energy Rating, making it eligible for a Green Mortgage with participating lenders. Combined with the recent improvements to the property, this offers prospective purchasers the benefit of a comfortable and energy-efficient home.\n\nThe location is another major advantage, with Kanturk town within walking distance, providing convenient access to shops, schools, cafés, sporting facilities and everyday services. The property offers an excellent balance between the convenience of town living and the space and comfort of a substantial modern home.\n\n51 Ashdale represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious, energy-efficient and turnkey three-bedroom home in a highly convenient Kanturk location. With its generous C. 137 sq.m. floor area, B3 energy rating, recent refurbishment, end-of-terrace position and attractive outdoor space, this is a property that is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, families and those seeking a quality home close to the heart of Kanturk.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with sole selling agents DNG Ryan.\n\nEntrance 6.2 x 2.7 laminate flooring, storage under stairs\n\nKitchen 3.4 x 6.8 tiled flooring, open plan\n\nDining room 3.7 x 3.5 laminate flooring, open plan, glass doors to decking\n\nLiving room 4.8 x 3.9 laminate flooring, open plan\n\nUtility room 1.3 x 2.5 tiled, side door\n\nToilet 1.5 x 1.5 tiled\n\n1st floor:\n\nLanding 3.4 x 4.5 laminate flooring\n\nBathroom 3.3 x 2.2 floor to ceiling tiled, free standing bath\n\nBedroom 3.6 x 3.2 laminate flooring, built in wardrobe\n\nEn suite 2.4 x 0.9 shower, floor to ceiling tiles\n\nBedroom 2.8 x 2.7 laminate flooring\n\nBedroom 3.3 x 3.4 built in wardrobes, laminate flooring\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n3 bed, 3 bath\nLarge end of terrace home\nExpands to C. 137sqm\nB3 Energy rating - green mortgage\nAll done up in the last 3 years\nOff street parking to the front\nMains sewage\nMains water\nBuilt C. 2006\nOil fired central heating\nGarden to rear with decking\nCentral vacuum system\nWater softener\nAttic floored \nIn turn key condition\n\nThese particulars have been prepared by DNG John Ryan and whilst every care has been taken to ensure that these are accurate and correct, we are not responsible for any errors, omissions, inaccuracies, if the property is let, sold or withdrawn from sale or if it is not suitable for your purpose. These particulars are for information only and are given under the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract. Neither whole nor any part of this document or any reference thereto may be included in any public document, circular or statement nor published without the written consent of DNG John Ryan. PSL: 003615"
      },
